<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"></span>
<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">2</span>
<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">[2, 4]</span>
<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">[<a href="#A7.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ G.1.1 Dense Mixture-of-Experts ‣ G.1 Verification of Linear Mode Connectivity across diverse configurations ‣ Appendix G Experimental Results ‣ On Linear Mode Connectivity of Mixture-of-Experts Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, <a href="#A7.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ G.1.1 Dense Mixture-of-Experts ‣ G.1 Verification of Linear Mode Connectivity across diverse configurations ‣ Appendix G Experimental Results ‣ On Linear Mode Connectivity of Mixture-of-Experts Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>]</span>
