<span id="S5.T1.8.1.1.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">[<a href="#A7.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ G.1.1 Dense Mixture-of-Experts ‣ G.1 Verification of Linear Mode Connectivity across diverse configurations ‣ Appendix G Experimental Results ‣ On Linear Mode Connectivity of Mixture-of-Experts Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, <a href="#A7.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ G.1.1 Dense Mixture-of-Experts ‣ G.1 Verification of Linear Mode Connectivity across diverse configurations ‣ Appendix G Experimental Results ‣ On Linear Mode Connectivity of Mixture-of-Experts Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, <a href="#A7.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ G.1.1 Dense Mixture-of-Experts ‣ G.1 Verification of Linear Mode Connectivity across diverse configurations ‣ Appendix G Experimental Results ‣ On Linear Mode Connectivity of Mixture-of-Experts Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>]</span>
